timestamp=2026-11-09T05:04:43.813Z level=INFO run=80bcc019 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 << 'PY'\npath = '/app/dataset/genealogy_trees.txt'\nwith open(path) as f:\n    lines = f.readlines()\n\n# So Juliusz Dębosz is at col 2940 on line 82. Dawid is at col 2952 on line 92.\n# The connection goes from Dawid down? Or up - parent is Juliusz? \n# Looking at line 83, there's a junction '+' near the area connecting to Juliusz's branch.\n# Also look at line 83: \"Rozalia Grzesiek\" appears further right (we saw earlier ~2973). That suggests a couple.\n# Let us look for who is the spouse/partner of Juliusz Dębosz - often in ASCII trees, parents are placed side by side above child.\n# Look at line 82-83: Juliusz Dębosz is on left side of the branch, and Rozalia appears on line 83 on right side.\nl83 = lines[83]\nfor m in __import__('re').finditer(r'Rozalia', l83):\n    print(m.start(), m.group(0))\nPY" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
